{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The truth is optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious pseudo-animal organization illegally kidnaps dogs, for which they organize fundraisers under the pretext of saving their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reality turns out to be completely different. You stumble upon their fraud, which you want to expose to the whole world, but they will do anything to prevent that from happening. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story inspired by real events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Little Brothers is a third-person shooter featuring bullet time mechanics and a complex storyline inspired by arthouse cinema from studios like A24.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   - Face the dark echoes of your past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Save animals held captive in various locations from death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engage in spectacular combat accompanied by advanced environmental destruction and bullet time mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover a plot full of twists and turns and complex symbolism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fantastic gameplay lasting about two hours at a low price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Engaging levels introducing new, unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- All this in the face of the inevitable apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959720?t=1770357339","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3959720?t=1770357339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959720/839a4772dcd130bc634e77f3801c1f8ed236a4f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770357339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3959720/839a4772dcd130bc634e77f3801c1f8ed236a4f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770357339","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descr